WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Escape Velocity (Ad Astra) (Radio Edit)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:42.203
[Part I: The Cage — Instrumental Intro with Heavy Guitar & Synth Swells]

00:00:42.203 --> 00:00:47.500
The walls are cold, the air is thin

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:52.200
The noise outside is closing in

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:57.540
I'm running from the face I see, the "victim-saint" they made of me

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:03.741
This rage is just a heavy stone, a gravity I've outgrown

00:01:03.741 --> 00:01:08.690
Shedding skin, shedding weight

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:15.500
Escaping from this world of hate

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:21.596
[Part II: Ignition (Ad Astra) — Driving Drum & Synth Sequencer Transition]

00:01:21.596 --> 00:01:26.500
I see a light in the endless black, a signal calling, no turning back

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:35.479
The pull of the old world fades away, a new horizon, a new day

00:01:35.479 --> 00:01:42.321
I'm climbing, climbing, past the point of no return

00:01:42.321 --> 00:01:48.842
I'm flying, flying, with a fire I let burn

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:54.000
Just a signal, a distant light

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:02.000
Burning through the endless night... Ad astra!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:21.335
[Part III: The Cosmos (Loved by the Sun) — Soaring Melodic Guitar Interlude]

00:02:21.335 --> 00:02:26.500
I'm floating now, the engine's off

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.742
The silence is a holy sound

00:02:31.742 --> 00:02:37.066
The rage is gone, the fear is lost, in this new universe I've found

00:02:37.066 --> 00:02:43.531
I'm loved by the sun, I'm held by the void, an orbit just begun, a life not destroyed

00:02:43.531 --> 00:02:49.000
And the stars are singing a song I understand

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:56.500
I'm finally, finally reaching for your hand

00:02:56.500 --> 00:04:07.794
[Instrumental Bridge — Soaring Melodic Electric Guitar Solo]

00:04:07.794 --> 00:04:14.996
The walls are gone

00:04:14.996 --> 00:04:21.500
The air is clear

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:27.922
There is no noise

00:04:27.922 --> 00:04:35.000
There is no fear

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:58.500
Ad astra... Ad astra...

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:09.800
[Outro — Shimmering Ambient Synth & Guitar Fadeout]
